<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-24T14:02:19.642Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:02:19 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Recent drone attacks near Khartoum have killed four people and damaged a United Nations building, while another strike hit residential areas and a second UN facility, threatening humanitarian operations. RSF forces have assaulted aid offices in Nyala and a shelter in West Kordofan, causing civilian casualties, and charity kitchens in Khartoum are closing, deepening hardship for displaced Sudanese. New defections include the RSF counterintelligence chief, a commander and a group joining the Sudanese army in Khartoum, indicating shifting loyalties within the conflict. The war produced 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://reliefweb.int/report/sudan/unhcr-iom-vulnerability-profiling-dashboard-october-2026&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb (OCHA)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxNc2c5YVR5ejB2ZlN3RC1wNXVoSUtmc3hsems4MnJDN0pZeWpXaGhEcl96QTVCb3pzNlpoaGhxZVh0OHg2UUw5cnFkSHh2MGpxNklzTGtCZE5Cd2FvUnFJT1ctVTdOZjhOMG9JQ2JkdDRIdkNpR05WQjdUMmRQUVowdmFqaWdFdVdSbENkWUI4ZURmMFpXVEFTbFVB?oc=5&quot;&gt;OCHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidEFVX3lxTFAwRnppTjJVRXJ2VHJTdzVIZ3JWWGFPcDM3VnNxdjROeVhieTU0VVVEQkJmVmJ1RWNZT0xJbFVOSVZIYTVaVXp6S3FzdnBvbWNLNDBVUGEzYmRUMC1UcVVRMTl0M0pLdklNSVNNYjZ4VkdXQ1F4?oc=5&quot;&gt;The House of Commons Library&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxQdEQ3NmRNS1NZU2ZmekNlbE9EUHBnS2o3SjJoWEp1dE1YaE9JY0pPV0pEeUVTODZCNmRkU1NUSXd5Y3ozRDlWWExaTWRZdl9EVEVmOVFMM0dVbFJ3aEc2N0h3NnhhaG1mNnlnaF9jd3A5bGQxNHFfU2UyYXFQM3l6QWNScFRpQVNBVzJCSGVYRmVQdFE2VXJydzdydkhkQWU5?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot